N|               DAGGER.  PHOTOS of ROWENA on stage. Family PHOTOS.                   
O|
N|               -- MUSICAL CHAIRS: Time kept with AN ANTIQUE METRONOME CLOCK         
N|               -- A CRUSH OF CHILDREN FIGHT TO SIT, as --                           
