O|                                                                 13.                
O|
N,G,I|               FIND:  THE BOY IN THE MORETTA MASK. LEOPOLD FERRIER, 10,             
N,I|               preternaturally mature. While the orphans attack the buffet          
N|               he is content to sit alone, A VOLUME of Poe on his lap --            
N,I|               Which someone SNAPS shut: OLGA SEMINOFF. Her housekeeper’s           
N,I|               uniform crisp. Her opinions severe and fixed and many.               
N,I|               Kindness under hard layers of brimstone certainty. But she           
N|               cares for Leopold enormously.                                        
