N|               POIROT AND ARIADNE                                                   
O|
C|                                   POIROT                                           
U|                         And this is our hostess? This is the                       
U|                         soprano, Rowena Drake. I know her from                     
U|                         the Opéra-Comique -- La Scalla. A diva’s                   
U|                         life of glamour. But she lives here?                       
C|                                   ARIADNE OLIVER                                   
U|                         Where did all the money go? Everyone who                   
U|                         ever lived here falls victim to some                       
U|                         tragedy, that’s the legend anyway. “The                    
U|                         Children’s Vendetta.” Someone sees a                       
U|                         child’s shadow on the wall, then the                       
U|                         darkness comes. Like her daughter a year                   
U|                         ago.  That’s who we’re to hear from                        
U|                         tonight. The lost girl from beyond...                      
O|
