U|                         as one of their own. One with something                    
U|                         to say would be wise to come to you.                       
C|                                   POIROT                                           
U|                         You talk like Ms. Reynolds.                                
O|
C|                                   LEOPOLD                                          
U|                         She only pretended to know. No wonder                      
U|                         they got cross with her.                                   
O|
C|                                   POIROT                                           
U|                         You have much sympathy for the dead.                       
O|
C|                                   LEOPOLD                                          
U|                         Some of them are my friends.                               
O|
O|
